# Landfall targets any creature and only counts lands Bot1 controls. Bot2's land entering on turn 2 puts nothing on Bill (checked before Bot1's first land). Bot1's lands on turns 3, 5 and 7 put counters on Bill, on
# its own Ornithopter and on Bot2's Llanowar Elves. On turn 7 {3}{G}{G} then doubles the +1/+1 counters on each creature Bot1 controls: Bill 1 to 2 and the Ornithopter 1 to 2, while Bot2's Elves keeps
# its single counter and Haywire Mite, which has none, stays at none.

